#para([#text("At the rear are a display-source selector, a composite-video RCA input and an audio output socket. That RCA jack is for video, not a general audio connection. The audio socket sends sound out to external speakers or headphones. Use the source selector’s HDMI setting for the Raspberry Pi picture.")])
